{"unit_id":"tag:003F:statement","translation":"水平的（horizontal）和竖直的（vertical）合成（compositions）具有下列性质：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0001>与<MATH_0002>满足结合律（associative），\n<STRUCT_0003> 恒等变换（identity transformations）<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>的单位（units），\n<STRUCT_0004> 恒等（identity）函子（functors）的恒等变换（identity transformations）\n<MATH_0005>\n是<MATH_0006>与<MATH_0007>的单位（units），并且\n<STRUCT_0005> 给定图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0008>，\n有<MATH_0009>。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平的"},{"source_term":"vertical","target_term":"竖直的"},{"source_term":"compositions","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"associative","target_term":"结合律"},{"source_term":"identity transformations","target_term":"恒等变换"},{"source_term":"units","target_term":"单位"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"identity transformations","target_term":"恒等变换"},{"source_term":"units","target_term":"单位"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平的","context":"变换的水平合成；待决。"},{"source_term":"vertical","target_term":"竖直的","context":"变换的竖直合成；待决。"},{"source_term":"compositions","target_term":"合成","context":"两种变换合成；待决。"},{"source_term":"associative","target_term":"结合律","context":"两种合成的结合性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"identity transformations","target_term":"恒等变换","context":"合成运算的单位变换；待决。"},{"source_term":"units","target_term":"单位","context":"合成运算的单位；待决。"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等","context":"恒等函子的恒等性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"所给恒等函子；待决。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表","context":"交换律所对应的图表；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:003F:proof","translation":"利用先前的记号，最后一个陈述变为如下方程（equation）：\n<MATH_0001>\n将上面的结果应用于中间的合成（composition），可以将左端改写为\n<MATH_0002>，\n容易证明它等于（equal）右端。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"equation","target_term":"方程"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"equal","target_term":"等于"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"equation","target_term":"方程","context":"由最后一个陈述写出的等式；待决。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"合成","context":"左端中间的变换合成；待决。"},{"source_term":"equal","target_term":"等于","context":"计算所得表达式与右端相等；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:003D:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n引理条件(4)的另一种表述是：函子（functors）的合成（composition）及函子（functors）间变换（transformation）的水平合成（horizontal composition）给出函子（functor）\n<MATH_0001>，\n其源（source）为积（product）范畴（category），见定义<REF_0001>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"transformation","target_term":"变换"},{"source_term":"horizontal composition","target_term":"水平合成"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"source","target_term":"源"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"合成","context":"函子的合成；待决。"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"原先给定及变换涉及的函子；待决。"},{"source_term":"horizontal composition","target_term":"水平合成","context":"函子间变换的水平合成；待决。"},{"source_term":"transformation","target_term":"变换","context":"函子之间的变换；待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"两种合成共同给出的函子；待决。"},{"source_term":"source","target_term":"源","context":"该函子的定义域；待决。"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积","context":"源范畴的积构造；待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"该积构造所形成的范畴；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
